{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Food No Drink</strong>, a game where you step into the shoes of a <strong>devious</strong> <strong>student</strong> on a mission to fulfil your hunger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192600/extras/explore.gif?t=1744018563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can earn snacks or drinks as <strong>rewards</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192600/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744018563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your tools to avoid detection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192600/extras/gif5.gif?t=1744018563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on various tasks from your fellow students, from finding lost items to solving tricky puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192600/extras/gif6.gif?t=1744018563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Earn Rewards:</strong> Collect a variety of snacks and drinks as rewards for your hard work. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Stealth Mode:</strong> Enjoy your treats without getting caught by the librarian. Use your tools to avoid detection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Abilities:</strong> Use your earned points to purchase abilities from the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maps:</strong> The librarian\u2019s patrol pattern &amp; security level change each map.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.co